#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:1 docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:5
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Satellite Guide"
msgstr "卫星指南"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:8
msgid "How to run, configure, and implement a Satellite app that speaks SAP."
msgstr "如何运行、配置并实现使用 SAP 的 Satellite 应用。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment modes"
msgstr "部署模式"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:12
msgid "Hub learns about Satellites in two ways:"
msgstr "Hub 通过两种方式发现 Satellite："

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed (config + systemd)"
msgstr "托管（配置 + systemd）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare a process in `~/.anima/config.yaml`. `anima service start/stop/restart` writes `anima-satellite-<name>.service` user units (when systemd is available) and starts/stops them with `anima.service`.\n"
msgstr "在 `~/.anima/config.yaml` 中声明进程。`anima service start/stop/restart` 会写入 `anima-satellite-<name>.service` 用户单元（在 systemd 可用时），并与 `anima.service` 一并启动/停止。\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"satellites:\n"
"  parlor:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    command: bun\n"
"    args: [\"satellites/parlor/dev.ts\"]\n"
"    env:\n"
"      SATELLITE_PORT: \"4174\"\n"
"  pair-programming:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    command: bun\n"
"    args: [\"satellites/pair-programming/dev.ts\"]\n"
"    env:\n"
"      STUDIO_WORKSPACE: /path/to/project\n"
"      SATELLITE_PORT: \"4173\"\n"
msgstr ""
"satellites:\n"
"  parlor:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    command: bun\n"
"    args: [\"satellites/parlor/dev.ts\"]\n"
"    env:\n"
"      SATELLITE_PORT: \"4174\"\n"
"  pair-programming:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    command: bun\n"
"    args: [\"satellites/pair-programming/dev.ts\"]\n"
"    env:\n"
"      STUDIO_WORKSPACE: /path/to/project\n"
"      SATELLITE_PORT: \"4173\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field              | Role                                             |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `command` / `args` | Process to run (required for managed satellites) |\n"
"| `env`              | Extra environment variables                      |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 字段               | 作用                                             |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `command` / `args` | 要运行的进程（托管卫星必填）                     |\n"
"| `env`              | 额外环境变量                                     |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:40
msgid ""
"Working directory is derived by anima from the install layout (monorepo root "
"or CLI package root), not configured here."
msgstr ""
"工作目录由 anima 根据安装布局（monorepo 根目录或 CLI 包根目录）推导，不在此处"
"配置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Startup:** managed satellites start only after Hub `GET /api/health` returns `status: ok`.\n"
msgstr "**启动：** 托管卫星仅在 Hub `GET /api/health` 返回 `status: ok` 之后才会启动。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:44
msgid ""
"See [service.md](../guide/service.md) for systemd unit paths and startup "
"order."
msgstr ""
"有关 systemd 单元路径与启动顺序，见 [service.md](../guide/service.md)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamic (SAP connect)"
msgstr "动态（SAP connect）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:48
msgid ""
"No `command` in config. Start the satellite yourself; it connects to Hub via "
"SAP WebSocket. Instances appear on Chamber → Satellites after connect."
msgstr ""
"配置中不写 `command`。自行启动卫星；它通过 SAP WebSocket 连接 Hub。连接后实例"
"会出现在卧室 → 卫星中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:50
msgid "There is **no** global `studio:` section in `config.yaml`."
msgstr "`config.yaml` 中**没有**全局 `studio:` 段。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:52
msgid ""
"Open managed satellite UI at the URL from Chamber (SAP `http_url`), "
"typically:"
msgstr "在卧室提供的 URL（SAP `http_url`）打开托管卫星 UI，通常为："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:55
msgid "Parlor: `http://127.0.0.1:4174`"
msgstr "会客厅：`http://127.0.0.1:4174`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:55
msgid "Pair-programming: `http://127.0.0.1:4173`"
msgstr "结对编程：`http://127.0.0.1:4173`"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Satellite access modes"
msgstr "卫星访问模式"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Rule:** each `app_id + instance_id` has **at most one** Hub WebSocket (`/sap/v1`).\n"
msgstr "**规则：** 每个 `app_id + instance_id` **最多**拥有一条 Hub WebSocket（`/sap/v1`）。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Type A — Browser-direct (Parlor)"
msgstr "Type A — 浏览器直连（会客厅）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:65
msgid ""
"Browser `createSapBrowserClient` → Hub `/sap/v1` (this is the instance's "
"only Hub WS)."
msgstr ""
"浏览器 `createSapBrowserClient` → Hub `/sap/v1`（这是该实例唯一的 Hub WS）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:65
msgid "Satellite HTTP serves static UI + `/config.json` only."
msgstr "Satellite HTTP 仅提供静态 UI 与 `/config.json`。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:65
msgid ""
"**Limits:** no `tool.register` or local workspace tools; browser must reach "
"Hub on the LAN; multiple tabs share one `instance_id` (last connect wins in "
"Hub today)."
msgstr ""
"**限制：** 无 `tool.register` 或本地工作区工具；浏览器必须能在局域网访问 "
"Hub；多个标签页共享同一 `instance_id`（目前 Hub 上后连者胜出）。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Type B — Process gateway + local relay (pair-programming)"
msgstr "Type B — 进程网关 + 本地中继（结对编程）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:71
msgid "Satellite **process** holds the sole Hub WS via `runSapTransport`."
msgstr "Satellite **进程**通过 `runSapTransport` 持有唯一的 Hub WS。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:71
msgid ""
"Browser uses `createSapRelayBrowserClient` → satellite `/sap/relay/v1` (SAP "
"frame pass-through, **not** REST hub-api)."
msgstr ""
"浏览器使用 `createSapRelayBrowserClient` → satellite `/sap/relay/v1`（SAP 帧"
"透传，**非** REST hub-api）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:71
msgid ""
"Local FS/terminal stay on satellite HTTP/WS; agent tools run in the process "
"via `tool.register`."
msgstr ""
"本地 FS/终端留在 satellite HTTP/WS 上；代理工具在进程中通过 `tool.register` "
"运行。"

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph parlor [Parlor Type A]\n"
"    B1[Browser] -->|唯一 SAP WS| Hub1[Hub]\n"
"    S1[静态 server] -.->|/config.json| B1\n"
"  end\n"
"\n"
"  subgraph ppy [Pair-programming Type B]\n"
"    B2[Browser] -->|relay WS| Relay[\"/sap/relay/v1\"]\n"
"    Relay --> ProcSAP[runSapTransport]\n"
"    ProcSAP -->|唯一 SAP WS| Hub2[Hub]\n"
"    B2 --> LocalFS[\"/api/studio/*\"]\n"
"    B2 --> LocalPTY[本地 terminal WS]\n"
"    ProcSAP --> ToolExec[tool executor]\n"
"  end\n"
msgstr ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph parlor [Parlor Type A]\n"
"    B1[Browser] -->|唯一 SAP WS| Hub1[Hub]\n"
"    S1[静态 server] -.->|/config.json| B1\n"
"  end\n"
"\n"
"  subgraph ppy [Pair-programming Type B]\n"
"    B2[Browser] -->|relay WS| Relay[\"/sap/relay/v1\"]\n"
"    Relay --> ProcSAP[runSapTransport]\n"
"    ProcSAP -->|唯一 SAP WS| Hub2[Hub]\n"
"    B2 --> LocalFS[\"/api/studio/*\"]\n"
"    B2 --> LocalPTY[本地 terminal WS]\n"
"    ProcSAP --> ToolExec[tool executor]\n"
"  end\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Deprecated:** HTTP hub-api REST→SAP proxy (removed).\n"
msgstr "**已弃用：** HTTP hub-api REST→SAP 代理（已移除）。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parlor satellite"
msgstr "会客厅卫星"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:94
msgid ""
"Browser connects to Hub via SAP WebSocket from the client ([`browser-"
"client.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/browser-client.ts)); static "
"server only serves UI + `/config.json`."
msgstr ""
"浏览器通过客户端（[`browser-client.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/"
"browser-client.ts)）以 SAP WebSocket 连接 Hub；静态 server 仅提供 UI 与 `/"
"config.json`。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pair-programming satellite"
msgstr "结对编程卫星"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:98
msgid ""
"Browser connects to [`/sap/relay/v1`](../../satellites/pair-programming/"
"server/sap/relay.ts); the process multiplexes session/stream/tool traffic on "
"one Hub WS. Terminal PTY runs locally ([`terminal-session.ts`](../../"
"satellites/pair-programming/server/terminal-session.ts))."
msgstr ""
"浏览器连接 [`/sap/relay/v1`](../../satellites/pair-programming/server/sap/"
"relay.ts)；进程在一条 Hub WS 上多路复用会话/流/工具流量。终端 PTY 在本地运行"
"（[`terminal-session.ts`](../../satellites/pair-programming/server/terminal-"
"session.ts)）。"

